OL,3,GNEWSAProtection for pumphouse after
OL,4,Ademolition outcry
OL,5,
OL,6,FA protection notice has been placed on
OL,7,Fan "important" Lincolnshire pumping
OL,8,Fstation, which had its chimney
OL,9,Fearmarked for demolition.
OL,11,FIn September, Owston Ferry pumping
OL,12,Fstation was subject to a planning
OL,13,Fapplication to remove its chimney
OL,14,Ffollowing a safety inspection.
OL,16,FMore than 230 residents objected to the
OL,17,Fapplication, submitted by its owners,
OL,18,Fthe Isle of Axholme and North
OL,19,FNottinghamshire Water Level Management
OL,20,FBoard, to North Lincolnshire Council.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
