OL,4,Ademolition outcry
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader Rob Waltham said the
OL,7,Fbuilding preservation notice issued by
OL,8,Fthe authority "gives Historic England
OL,9,Fthe time it needs to properly consider
OL,10,Fthe building's future".
